{"id":"n66925-2-4","stage":4,"title":"아흐레 · 九号","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66925-2-4-1","ko":"일월 아흐레에 동창 모임을 가지려고 합니다.","zh":"我们打算一月九日举办同学聚会。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일월","meaning":"一月","explanation":"일월：一月","readings":[{"term":"일월","audio":"/audio/7bead6f7b37c675df4ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26894","senseId":"1","lemma":"일월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아흐레에","meaning":"九号，九日","explanation":"아흐레：九号，九日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아흐레","audio":"/audio/87edfd44e5a02851a1c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66925","senseId":"2","lemma":"아흐레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동창","meaning":"同学，校友，同窗","explanation":"동창：同学，校友，同窗","readings":[{"term":"동창","audio":"/audio/c122acabdc3fe813b225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48104","senseId":"1","lemma":"동창","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모임을","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지려고","meaning":"开，举办，举行","explanation":"가지다：开，举办，举行；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"4","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합니다.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7bead6f7b37c675d","term":"일월","zh":"一月","audio":"/audio/7bead6f7b37c675df4ce.mp3","entryId":"26894","definition":"一年十二个月中的第一个月。","pronunciation":["이뤌"]},{"id":"87edfd44e5a02851","term":"아흐레","zh":"九号，九日","audio":"/audio/87edfd44e5a02851a1c9.mp3","entryId":"66925","definition":"每月第一天数起的第九个日子。","pronunciation":["아흐레"]},{"id":"c122acabdc3fe813","term":"동창","zh":"同学，校友，同窗","audio":"/audio/c122acabdc3fe813b225.mp3","entryId":"48104","definition":"在同一所学校学习的关系。","pronunciation":["동창"]},{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"开，举办，举行","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"召开会议或聚会，进行演出等。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad8e06a1bb93343e6b21.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66925-2-4-2","ko":"네, 그럼 그날 봅시다.","zh":"好，那天见。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그날","meaning":"那天，那日","explanation":"그날：那天，那日","readings":[{"term":"그날","audio":"/audio/f243f3eadf4a87a81a35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36674","senseId":"1","lemma":"그날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봅시다.","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그